<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Westinghouse started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Frank Bodencheck initiated coverage of Westinghouse Electric Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on Monday at 17-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
